---
// Interactive distributed lease + fencing token simulator wrapped in DemoFrame.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import DistLeaseFencingDemo from '../demos/DistLeaseFencingDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="dlf-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Fencing tokens vs. pauses, delayed packets, and clock jumps" titleVi="Fencing token trước khựng tiến trình, gói tin trễ và nhảy đồng hồ">
    <DistLeaseFencingDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Try each fault with Fencing Tokens toggled off and on. Switching from a wall clock to a monotonic clock saves you from an NTP jump, but only fencing tokens checked by the storage server stop a paused process or a delayed packet.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hãy thử từng sự cố khi bật và tắt Fencing Token. Đổi từ wall-clock sang monotonic clock giúp tránh được cú nhảy NTP, nhưng chỉ fencing token do chính server lưu trữ kiểm tra mới chặn nổi tiến trình bị khựng hay gói tin kẹt mạng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .dlf-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .dlf-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .dlf-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .dlf .sd-group > span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dlf .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .dlf .sd-stat b {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .dlf .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .dlf-nodes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .dlf-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 9px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .dlf-node.is-active {
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dlf-node.is-warn {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
  }
  .dlf-node.is-good {
    border-color: #16a34a;
  }
  .dlf-node.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .dlf-node-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .dlf-node-state {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dlf-node.is-bad .dlf-node-state {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .dlf-node.is-good .dlf-node-state {
    color: #15803d;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .dlf-node.is-good .dlf-node-state {
    color: #4ade80;
  }
  .dlf-log {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .dlf-log-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 12px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .dlf-log-item.is-warn {
    border-left-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .dlf-log-item.is-ok {
    border-left-color: #16a34a;
  }
  .dlf-log-item.is-bad {
    border-left-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .dlf-log-time {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    min-width: 72px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dlf-log-msg {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 220px;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .dlf-log-item.is-bad .dlf-log-msg {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
